Rucene
Copyright (c) 2026 Flávio CF Oliveira

Rucene is a Rust port of Apache Lucene 10.5.0. It contains code translated
from Apache Lucene and resources copied from it, together with the third-party
material listed below. The attributions for Apache Lucene are taken from the
NOTICE.txt file of Apache Lucene 10.5.0, limited to the material Rucene embeds.

Apache Lucene, spatial4j, s2-geometry-library-java, NekoHTML and Apache
Xerces-J are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose full text is
in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. ICU4J is licensed under the Unicode License V3,
whose full text is in crates/icu4j/LICENSE.

