===========================================================================
ICU4J
===========================================================================

crates/icu4j/ is a Rust translation of the ICU4J 77.1 classes that Apache
Lucene 10.5.0 lucene/analysis/icu reaches (com.ibm.icu:icu4j:77.1, tag
release-77-1). Each translated file keeps its ICU copyright line:

  © 2016 and later: Unicode, Inc. and others.
  License & terms of use: http://www.unicode.org/copyright.html

crates/icu4j/data/ embeds 3476 ICU data files, byte-identical to the
icu4j-77.1.jar that Lucene 10.5.0 uses (SHA-1
38693cf0b1d7362a8b726af74dc06026a7c23809), among them the break-iterator
dictionaries burmesedict, cjdict, khmerdict, laodict and thaidict.

ICU4J and its data are distributed under the Unicode License V3
(Copyright © 2016-2025 Unicode, Inc.). The full text, with the third-party
notices of the Chinese/Japanese, Lao and Burmese word-break dictionaries and
the other third-party software ICU includes, is in crates/icu4j/LICENSE: the
LICENSE file of ICU at tag release-77-1, unchanged.

