NekoHTML
===========================================================================

crates/nekohtml/ is a Rust translation of the part of the CyberNeko HTML
Parser 1.9.17 (net.sourceforge.nekohtml:nekohtml:1.9.17) that Apache Lucene
10.5.0 lucene/benchmark uses, with its message and entity resource files
(crates/nekohtml/src/org/cyberneko/html/res/) copied unchanged. NekoHTML is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its notice, as Apache Lucene
10.5.0 distributes it (lucene/licenses/nekohtml-NOTICE.txt), reads:

  CyberNeko HTML Parser
  (C) Copyright 2002-2009, Andy Clark, Marc Guillemot. All rights reserved.

